></li><li><em>More coming soon!</em></li></ul></nav></div><h2 id="dialog" class="c-gtEwPZ">Dialog</h2><div class="c-gCYHyO"><div><p>A dialog is an interactive overlay component, such as a dismissible alert or confirmation window, that separates content from the rest of the page.</p><div class="c-zNLhb"><h3 id="dialog-role" class="c-csgxlc">role</h3><p>This attribute <code class="c-cKnJaI">role=&quot;dialog&quot;</code> tells the browser and assistive technology that this element is a dialog, and its content should be separated from the page&#x27;s content.</p><ul><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Roles/dialog_role">MDN dialog role documentation</a></li><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#dialog">WAI-ARIA dialog role documentation</a></li></ul></div><div class="c-zNLhb"><h3 id="dialog-modal" class="c-csgxlc">aria-modal</h3><p>Indicates whether this dialog is modal or not.</p><p>Setting <code class="c-cKnJaI">aria-modal=&quot;true&quot;</code> tells assistive technology that nagivation is limited to the dialog, and everything else is hidden.</p><p>Note: This attribute does not provide the required focus and keyboard behavior to the dialog.</p><ul><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Attributes/aria-modal">MDN aria-modal documentation</a></li><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#aria-modal">WAI-ARIA aria-modal documentation</a></li></ul></div><div class="c-zNLhb"><h3 id="dialog-labelledby" class="c-csgxlc">aria-labelledby</h3><p>The attribute <code class="c-cKnJaI">aria-labelledby</code> provides contextual information for the controls inside the dialog.</p><p>All dialogs must be properly labelled.</p><ul><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Attributes/aria-labelledby">MDN aria-labelledby documentation</a></li><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#aria-labelledby">WAI-ARIA aria-labelledby documentation</a></li></ul></div><div class="c-zNLhb"><h3 id="dialog-describedby" class="c-csgxlc">aria-describedby</h3><p>The attribute <code class="c-cKnJaI">aria-describedby</code> provides additional context if available.</p><ul><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Attributes/aria-describedby">MDN aria-describedby documentation</a></li><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#aria-describedby">WAI-ARIA aria-describedby documentation</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="c-bCxFoc"><div class="c-dbjLXF"><button type="button" class="c-eOaeDC c-bZnvrs"><svg viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5.5l.277-.416L10.651 0H10.5v.5zm3 2h.5v-.268l-.223-.148-.277.416zm-1 9.5h-8v1h8v-1zM4 11.5v-10H3v10h1zM4.5 1h6V0h-6v1zM13 2.5v9h1v-9h-1zM10.223.916l3 2 .554-.832-3-2-.554.832zM4.5 12a.5.5 0 01-.5-.5H3A1.5 1.5 0 004.5 13v-1zm8 1a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5h-1a.5.5 0 01-.5.5v1zM4 1.5a.5.5 0 01.5-.5V0A1.5 1.5 0 003 1.5h1zm-3 2v10h1v-10H1zM2.5 15h8v-1h-8v1zm0-12h1V2h-1v1zM12 13.5v-1h-1v1h1zM10.5 15a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5h-1a.5.5 0 01-.5.5v1zM1 13.5A1.5 1.5 0 002.5 15v-1a.5.5 0 01-.5-.5H1zm1-10a.5.5 0 01.5-.5V2A1.5 1.5 0 001 3.5h1z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span class="c-idrgFA">Copy</span></button><pre class="prismjs"><code style="white-space:pre"><span class=""><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color:#c5c8c6">&lt;</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#96CBFE">button</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#96CBFE"> </span><span class="token tag attr-name" style="color:#A8FF60">type</span><span class="token tag attr-value punctuation attr-equals" style="color:#c5c8c6">=</span><span class="token tag attr-value punctuation" s