>aria-hidden</code> set to<!-- --> <code class="c-cKnJaI">&quot;true&quot;</code>, or do not render the popover.</p><ul><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Attributes/aria-hidden">MDN aria-hidden documentation</a></li><li>See:<!-- --> <a class="c-fizoGN" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#aria-hidden">WAI-ARIA aria-hidden documentation</a></li></ul></div><div class="c-zNLhb"><h3 id="popover-focusable" class="c-csgxlc">Focusable</h3><p>The popover must have a focusable element, and focus should be moved to the either first focusable element within the popover or the container when it is opened.</p></div></div><div class="c-bCxFoc"><div class="c-dbjLXF"><button type="button" class="c-eOaeDC c-bZnvrs"><svg viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5.5l.277-.416L10.651 0H10.5v.5zm3 2h.5v-.268l-.223-.148-.277.416zm-1 9.5h-8v1h8v-1zM4 11.5v-10H3v10h1zM4.5 1h6V0h-6v1zM13 2.5v9h1v-9h-1zM10.223.916l3 2 .554-.832-3-2-.554.832zM4.5 12a.5.5 0 01-.5-.5H3A1.5 1.5 0 004.5 13v-1zm8 1a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5h-1a.5.5 0 01-.5.5v1zM4 1.5a.5.5 0 01.5-.5V0A1.5 1.5 0 003 1.5h1zm-3 2v10h1v-10H1zM2.5 15h8v-1h-8v1zm0-12h1V2h-1v1zM12 13.5v-1h-1v1h1zM10.5 15a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5h-1a.5.5 0 01-.5.5v1zM1 13.5A1.5 1.5 0 002.5 15v-1a.5.5 0 01-.5-.5H1zm1-10a.5.5 0 01.5-.5V2A1.5 1.5 0 001 3.5h1z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span class="c-idrgFA">Copy</span></button><pre class="prismjs"><code style="white-space:pre"><span class=""><span class="token tag punctuation" style="color:#c5c8c6">&lt;</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#96CBFE">button</span><span class="token tag" style="color:#96CBFE">
